     mmaaiill is written to run set-user-id to rroooott, checking every
     file access itself against the invoking user's permissions.
     mmaaiill does not implement mail to a remote system in the form
     _s_y_s_t_e_m!uusseerr; attempting to send to such an address prints an
     error and the message is not delivered.

